pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#0D1117"
elements:
  - elementId: top-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 2]
    shape:
      shapeName: rectangle
      fill:
        type: solid
        color: "#D4A843"

  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 30, 1100, 50]
    content:
      style: "$pageTitle"
      text: |
        <p><b>Developers Are Forced to Choose: Power or Simplicity</b></p>

  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 85, 200, 2]
    shape:
      shapeName: rectangle
      fill:
        type: solid
        color: "#2D3648"

  - elementId: stat-box
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 130]
    shape:
      shapeName: rectangle
      fill:
        type: solid
        color: "#1E2538"
      border:
        style: solid
        width: 1
        color: "#2D3648"

  - elementId: stat-number
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 125, 300, 80]
    content:
      style: "$bigNumber"
      text: |
        <p><b>$50B+</b></p>

  - elementId: stat-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [420, 140, 700, 50]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      color: "#8B95A5"
      text: |
        <p>spent annually on database sprawl management across enterprises</p>

  - elementId: stat-source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [420, 195, 400, 25]
    content:
      style: "$annotation"
      text: |
        <p>Source: Gartner, 2025</p>

  - elementId: pain-1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 290, 32, 32]
    iconName: "alert-triangle"
    color: "#EF4444"

  - elementId: pain-1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [130, 285, 400, 40]
    content:
      style: "$accentText"
      text: |
        <p><b>Database Sprawl</b></p>

  - elementId: pain-1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [130, 325, 480, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      text: |
        <p>Enterprises run 5-7 different databases (PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, Elasticsearch, Neo4j, InfluxDB, Milvus) — each requiring a dedicated ops team.</p>

  - elementId: pain-2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 430, 32, 32]
    iconName: "link-break"
    color: "#F59E0B"

  - elementId: pain-2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [130, 425, 400, 40]
    content:
      style: "$accentText"
      text: |
        <p><b>Fragile Data Sync</b></p>

  - elementId: pain-2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [130, 465, 480, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      text: |
        <p>Syncing data between systems is expensive, slow, and error-prone. ETL pipelines break constantly, causing data inconsistency.</p>

  - elementId: pain-3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [680, 290, 32, 32]
    iconName: "clock"
    color: "#10B981"

  - elementId: pain-3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 285, 400, 40]
    content:
      style: "$accentText"
      text: |
        <p><b>40% Time Wasted</b></p>

  - elementId: pain-3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 325, 480, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      text: |
        <p>Engineers spend nearly half their time on data plumbing — migrations, syncs, and integration — instead of building product features.</p>

  - elementId: pain-4-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [680, 430, 32, 32]
    iconName: "shield-off"
    color: "#EF4444"

  - elementId: pain-4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 425, 400, 40]
    content:
      style: "$accentText"
      text: |
        <p><b>Security Nightmare</b></p>

  - elementId: pain-4-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 465, 480, 80]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 18
      text: |
        <p>Each database has its own security model. Managing RBAC, audit, and compliance across 5+ systems is a compliance auditor's worst nightmare.</p>

  - elementId: bottom-callout
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 590, 1160, 70]
    shape:
      shapeName: rectangle
      fill:
        type: solid
        color: "#1A1F36"
      border:
        style: solid
        width: 1
        color: "#D4A843"

  - elementId: bottom-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 605, 1080, 40]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><b style="color: #D4A843;">65% of enterprises plan to consolidate databases by 2027</b> — but there's no database that truly does it all.</p>

  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1200, 680, 60, 25]
    content:
      style: "$annotation"
      text: |
        <p style="text-align: right;">02</p>
